#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#AEB : Autonomous Emergency Braking
#CCRb : Car-to-Car Rear during Braking
#EVT : Euro Vehicle Target
#VUT : Vehicle Under Test
#
#A CarSim Sensors license is required to run this simulation.  You may still view the animation and plots.
#
#The procedure in this simulation is based on a test scenario published by Euro NCAP for AEB systems. Here, a target is moving at 50 m/h and decelerates at 6 m/s/s. The VUT is trailing with a distance of 12 m.
#
#The EVT speed is defined with an output parameter Vx_EVT that can be set as a constant or managed with an equation.
#
#This test has four combinations of two variants: the target can decelerate at 2 or 6 m/s/s; and the initial distance can be either 12 or 40 m. Set the target speed time history with the blue link on this page. Set START_DISTANCE in the misc. yellow field.
#
#The HUD alert and speed controller are very simple for this example. They are provided to demonstrate the scenario, and are not based on any known control systems.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

